      "text": "Query-shape rules: Postgres can't refuse a statement by its shape (a SELECT with no LIMIT, a bulk export, a query that joins every table). It also can't tell a sensitive read through a view or function from a plain one. FaultWall proxy today, in enforce mode: block by operation, table, column and function per agent.",
